{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 61,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 310.923,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now it came to pass that soon after Moroni had sent his epistle unto the chief governor,",
      "verse": "61:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.846,
      "end": 9.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he received an epistle from Pahoran, the chief governor.",
      "verse": "61:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.648,
      "end": 12.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the words which he received:",
      "verse": "61:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.836,
      "end": 20.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Pahoran, who am the chief governor of this land, do send these words unto Moroni, the chief captain over the army.",
      "verse": "61:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.493,
      "end": 22.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, Moroni,",
      "verse": "61:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.763,
      "end": 25.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I do not joy in your great afflictions,",
      "verse": "61:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 25.822,
      "end": 27.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it grieves my soul.",
      "verse": "61:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.267,
      "end": 32.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, there are those who do joy in your afflictions, yea,",
      "verse": "61:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.394,
      "end": 36.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they have risen up in rebellion against me,",
      "verse": "61:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.475,
      "end": 39.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also those of my people who are freemen,",
      "verse": "61:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.674,
      "end": 42.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and those who have risen up are exceedingly numerous.",
      "verse": "61:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.651,
      "end": 47.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it is those who have sought to take away the judgment-seat from me",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.593,
      "end": 51.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that have been the cause of this great iniquity;",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 51.674,
      "end": 53.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they have used great flattery,",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.897,
      "end": 57.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have led away the hearts of many people,",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 57.374,
      "end": 60.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which will be the cause of sore affliction among us;",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 60.851,
      "end": 62.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have withheld our provisions,",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.074,
      "end": 65.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have daunted our freemen",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 65.297,
      "end": 67.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they have not come unto you.",
      "verse": "61:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.835,
      "end": 70.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, they have driven me out before them,",
      "verse": "61:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.173,
      "end": 73.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have fled to the land of Gideon,",
      "verse": "61:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.907,
      "end": 77.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with as many men as it were possible that I could get.",
      "verse": "61:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 77.977,
      "end": 82.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I have sent a proclamation throughout this part of the land;",
      "verse": "61:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 82.569,
      "end": 88.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, they are flocking to us daily, to their arms, in the defence of their country and their freedom",
      "verse": "61:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 88.786,
      "end": 90.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to avenge our wrongs.",
      "verse": "61:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 91.138,
      "end": 92.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they have come unto us,",
      "verse": "61:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 92.99,
      "end": 101.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that those who have risen up in rebellion against us are set at defiance, yea, insomuch that they do fear us",
      "verse": "61:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 101.854,
      "end": 104.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and durst not come out against us to battle.",
      "verse": "61:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 105.274,
      "end": 110.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They have got possession of the land, or the city, of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 110.33,
      "end": 112.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have appointed a king over them,",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 113.111,
      "end": 116.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath written unto the king of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 116.635,
      "end": 120.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which he hath joined an alliance with him;",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 120.344,
      "end": 125.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which alliance he hath agreed to maintain the city of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 125.354,
      "end": 128.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which maintenance he supposeth will enable",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 128.32,
      "end": 131.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites to conquer the remainder of the land,",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 131.751,
      "end": 134.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall be placed king over this people",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 134.671,
      "end": 137.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they shall be conquered under the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "61:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 138.648,
      "end": 141.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, in your epistle you have censured me,",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 141.614,
      "end": 143.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it mattereth not;",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 143.466,
      "end": 146.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am not angry, but do rejoice in the greatness of your heart.",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 147.175,
      "end": 149.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Pahoran, do not seek for power,",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 149.584,
      "end": 152.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save only to retain my judgment-seat",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 152.411,
      "end": 156.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may preserve the rights and the liberty of my people.",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 156.353,
      "end": 161.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My soul standeth fast in that liberty in the which God hath made us free.",
      "verse": "61:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 161.77,
      "end": 165.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, we will resist wickedness even unto bloodshed.",
      "verse": "61:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 165.712,
      "end": 168.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We would not shed the blood of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "61:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 169.096,
      "end": 171.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if they would stay in their own land.",
      "verse": "61:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 172.377,
      "end": 175.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We would not shed the blood of our brethren",
      "verse": "61:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 175.251,
      "end": 179.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if they would not rise up in rebellion and take the sword against us.",
      "verse": "61:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 179.832,
      "end": 183.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We would subject ourselves to the yoke of bondage",
      "verse": "61:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 183.449,
      "end": 186.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were requisite with the justice of God,",
      "verse": "61:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 186.369,
      "end": 189.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or if he should command us so to do.",
      "verse": "61:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 189.696,
      "end": 191.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold he doth not command us",
      "verse": "61:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 192.152,
      "end": 195.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we shall subject ourselves to our enemies,",
      "verse": "61:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 195.49,
      "end": 198.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that we should put our trust in him,",
      "verse": "61:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 198.503,
      "end": 200.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will deliver us.",
      "verse": "61:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 200.855,
      "end": 204.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, my beloved brother, Moroni, let us resist evil,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 204.611,
      "end": 207.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whatsoever evil we cannot resist with our words,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 207.949,
      "end": 210.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, such as rebellions and dissensions,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 210.776,
      "end": 213.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let us resist them with our swords,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 213.371,
      "end": 215.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may retain our freedom,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 215.734,
      "end": 219.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may rejoice in the great privilege of our church,",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 219.258,
      "end": 221.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the cause of our Redeemer and our God.",
      "verse": "61:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 222.446,
      "end": 226.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, come unto me speedily with a few of your men,",
      "verse": "61:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 226.202,
      "end": 229.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and leave the remainder in the charge of Lehi and Teancum;",
      "verse": "61:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 229.586,
      "end": 235.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "give unto them power to conduct the war in that part of the land, according to the Spirit of God,",
      "verse": "61:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 235.246,
      "end": 239.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is also the spirit of freedom which is in them.",
      "verse": "61:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 239.688,
      "end": 242.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold I have sent a few provisions unto them,",
      "verse": "61:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 242.701,
      "end": 245.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may not perish until ye can come unto me.",
      "verse": "61:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 246.446,
      "end": 250.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Gather together whatsoever force ye can upon your march hither,",
      "verse": "61:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 250.62,
      "end": 254.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will go speedily against those dissenters,",
      "verse": "61:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 254.19,
      "end": 257.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the strength of our God according to the faith which is in us.",
      "verse": "61:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 258.585,
      "end": 262.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we will take possession of the city of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "61:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 262.527,
      "end": 267.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may obtain more food to send forth unto Lehi and Teancum;",
      "verse": "61:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 267.444,
      "end": 271.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we will go forth against them in the strength of the Lord,",
      "verse": "61:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 271.804,
      "end": 274.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will put an end to this great iniquity.",
      "verse": "61:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 275.503,
      "end": 278.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Moroni, I do joy in receiving your epistle,",
      "verse": "61:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 278.748,
      "end": 282.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I was somewhat worried concerning what we should do,",
      "verse": "61:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 282.365,
      "end": 285.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether it should be just in us to go against our brethren.",
      "verse": "61:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 286.482,
      "end": 292.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But ye have said, except they repent the Lord hath commanded you that ye should go against them.",
      "verse": "61:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 293.524,
      "end": 296.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "See that ye strengthen Lehi and Teancum in the Lord;",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 296.908,
      "end": 298.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "tell them to fear not,",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 298.806,
      "end": 300.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God will deliver them,",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 300.751,
      "end": 304.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also all those who stand fast in that liberty",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 304.368,
      "end": 306.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherewith God hath made them free.",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 306.824,
      "end": 310.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I close mine epistle to my beloved brother, Moroni.",
      "verse": "61:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    }
  ]
}